config:
  theme: default
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Frontend as Browser / Storefront
    participant App as App Builder
    participant State as Session Store
    participant Provider as Identity Provider
    participant Commerce as Adobe Commerce

    Note over User,Commerce: Phase 1 — Authenticate with the external provider
    User->>Frontend: Sign in with social provider
    Frontend->>App: Begin login
    App-->>Frontend: Redirect to provider
    Frontend->>Provider: Authenticate directly (front-channel)
    Note over Frontend,Provider: Credentials go only to the provider,<br>never to the storefront or App Builder
    Provider-->>App: Authorization code / ID token
    App->>App: Validate provider token,<br>read verified email + name
    App->>State: Create session, store internal token
    App-->>Frontend: Internal token

    Note over User,Commerce: Phase 2 — Bridge to Commerce (server-side, admin-scoped)
    Frontend->>App: getCustomerToken(internal token)
    App->>State: Validate token, load verified email
    State-->>App: Verified email (or reject)
    App->>Commerce: GET /V1/customers/search?email
    Commerce-->>App: customer or empty
    alt customer not found
        App->>Commerce: POST /V1/customers<br>(strong random password)
        Commerce-->>App: customer
    end
    App->>Commerce: POST /V1/customers/{id}/token
    Commerce-->>App: customer token
    App-->>Frontend: customer token

    Frontend->>Commerce: GraphQL with customer token
    Commerce-->>Frontend: response
